#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export to OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"
msgstr "OpenQASM 3로 내보내기 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export Qiskit code to OpenQASM 3 with `dumps()`, which exports to a "
"string, or `dump()`, which exports to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"`dumps()`를 사용하여 문자열로 내보내거나, `dump()`를 사용하여 파일로 내보내는 방법으로 Qiskit 코드를 OpenQASM"
" 3로 내보낼 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example with `dumps()` {#example-with-dumps}"
msgstr "`dumps()` 사용 예시 {#example-with-dumps}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example with `dump()` {#example-with-dump}"
msgstr "`dump()` 사용 예시 {#example-with-dump}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [Exporting to OpenQASM "
"3](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#exporting-to-openqasm-3) "
"section of the API reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"자세한 내용은 API 참조의 [OpenQASM 3로 "
"내보내기](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#exporting-to-openqasm-3)"
" 섹션을 참조하세요.\n"

